  steps:
  - headerText: Energy Barriers
    bodyText: 'You have stumbled across an Energy Barrier! These barriers are too
      powerful for you to cross them as it is. Keep exploring and see if you can
      find something to get past them!


      Hint: This has something to do with
      the concept of Quantum Tunneling!'
